          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પરી — parī — \"a fairy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વાર્તામાં એક સુંદર પરી હતી. vārtāmā̃ ek sundar parī hatī. There was a beautiful fairy in the story."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પરી (parī) is usually traced to Persian parī, \"a fairy\", the winged spirit of Persian tales. It is feminine: સુંદર પરી."
            }
          ]
        },
