              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દેખાવું (dekhāvũ) belongs with dekhvũ, to see, which CDIAL lists under dṛkṣati, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 6507): to be seen. What appears is the subject: પરી (parī) દેખાઈ, a fairy appeared."
